WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:26.082
Zippy did not like dirt paths.

2
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:33.863
He did not like rocks.

3
00:00:33.864 --> 00:00:37.168
"This stinks," said Zippy.

4
00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:40.262
"I have to drive slowly.

5
00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:45.168
And these rocks hurt!"

6
00:00:45.169 --> 00:00:48.006
Eddy grinned.

7
00:00:48.007 --> 00:00:53.570
Now he was faster than Zippy!

8
00:00:53.571 --> 00:01:00.126
"I see mud!" cried Poppy.

9
00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:15.799
Everybody drove through the mud.

10
00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.973
"Oh no!" said Zippy.

11
00:01:18.974 --> 00:01:23.422
"My tires are muddy!"

12
00:01:23.423 --> 00:01:26.840
Eddy went fast in the mud.

13
00:01:26.841 --> 00:01:29.209
The mud splashed.

14
00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:36.397
Splat! Mud sprayed all over Zippy.

15
00:01:36.398 --> 00:01:40.004
"Hey!" cried Zippy.

16
00:01:40.005 --> 00:01:43.255
Poppy splashed in the mud.

17
00:01:43.256 --> 00:01:49.958
Splat! "Ugh!" cried Zippy.

18
00:01:49.959 --> 00:01:54.240
Jeb and Dipper splashed in the mud.

19
00:01:54.241 --> 00:02:02.436
Splat! Splat!

20
00:02:02.437 --> 00:02:06.028
Zippy spun his tires.

21
00:02:06.029 --> 00:02:08.805
But the mud was deep.

22
00:02:08.806 --> 00:02:14.730
His tires went deeper.

23
00:02:14.731 --> 00:02:19.214
"Oh no!" cried Zippy.

24
00:02:19.215 --> 00:02:24.451
"I'm stuck in the mud!"
